# THE RUNTIME PROOF, with a negative control. One x86_64 emulator (API 30,
# `default` image, no Play services) with `emulator -tcpdump`, the capture taken
# at the virtual NIC and filtered to events whose SOURCE is the device. Both
# builds got the SAME treatment, including
