# and read back -- so the patched build was asked to auto-send, on purpose.
# Crash induced with `am crash <MAIN PID>`; note the pid matters, because
# `am crash <package>` picks the app zygote that isolated-process.patch turns on
# and the exception then never reaches Fenix's uncaught-exception handler.
#
#                                          before(stock)   after(this patch)
#   crash-reports.mozilla.com events            4                0
#   :crashReportingProcess spawned             yes               no
#   logcat "Crash report submitted to ..."     yes               no
#   content-process crash -> outbound events    0                0
